# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------#
# Document: .gitignore
# Description: Universal Shell Strategy for Apps & Data. 
#              Scalable for infinite nested applications.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------#

# --- 🚀 UNIVERSAL APPS SHELL ---
# 1. Ignore everything inside any subfolder of apps/
apps/*/**

# 2. Allow the main directory for each app to be tracked (the pointer)
!apps/*/

# --- 💾 UNIVERSAL DATA SHELL ---
# 1. Ignore everything inside the data/ folder
data/**

# 2. Keep only the data/ directory itself tracked
!data/
!data/.gitkeep

# --- 🐍 ROOT CORE PROTECTIONS ---
# Rules for the core/ and dev/ folders (outside of apps).
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.env
.env.*
.python-version

# --- 🖥️ OS & IDE SPECIFIC ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log